In the code under test, after executing the statement `arrList.Insert(index, x);`, index of x is expected to be more than or equal to 0. So I will write an assertion to validate this. Note that this is assuming the method `Insert` is implemented correctly. If it is not, different behavior may occur, and the assertion will fail.--------------------
